WEBVTT

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:26.890
Not the balls.

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:42.820
...and especially yoga!

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:44.770
What could I say for that, Bobo?

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:49.940
All those new tables the keeper has set will be helping us keep our calories down.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:52.280
But the keeper will be feeding us.

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:54.780
This is a shame for our sword privileges.

00:00:55.060 --> 00:00:59.380
As full beings from the Wild Desert we will put efforts to feed ourselves.

00:00:59.380 --> 00:00:59.760
As full beings from the Wild Desert we will put efforts to feed ourselves.

00:00:59.760 --> 00:00:59.960
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.140
and with a little help from the tourists, of course.

00:01:02.690 --> 00:01:03.490
But Yogi...

00:01:03.490 --> 00:01:04.530
Quiet, Bobo.

00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:05.740
There is a tourist.

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:07.780
He is carrying a basket full of sweets.

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:15.960
It's good that she came to Jellystone Park.

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:19.180
This basket is too heavy for a little girl.

00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:22.800
Yogi, you won't take the basket of the little girl.

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:24.900
I don't know, Bobo.

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:28.970
I'm just checking if there are any violations of the law on banning human labor.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.060
Lady, you're carrying a heavy stuff. What's inside?

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:37.040
Chocolate, strawberries, cookies, sweets, pizza.

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:38.980
Enough, stop.

00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:41.090
She'll manage to control herself.

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:43.010
For how much is all this?

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:46.540
Well, she lives in Tatek Hill.

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:47.910
See, girls?

00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:55.320
For grandma, it's nothing.

00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:58.560
Whatever it is, I don't like that Yogi.

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:04.950
Hello, grandma. This is your program with dance music.

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:09.770
If you tell us which letter is after D in the alphabet, you will get the first prize.

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:12.900
Well, the letter V.

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:18.120
That's right. You will win six free lessons in the dance studio in the city.

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:19.550
Go there right away.

00:02:20.270 --> 00:02:23.140
I will go. I will go.

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:27.400
Now I just have to go to the grandma's place and get the snacks.

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:33.660
Six free dance lessons, crazy man, crazy!

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:38.640
Hey, red hat, jump inside, we're going to town!

00:02:40.670 --> 00:02:41.310
To the pub!

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:43.900
Get those sandwiches!

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:48.170
We're going to dance!

00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:52.700
I hope Yogi doesn't attract trouble.

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:57.400
Oh, the little girl has lost her red hat and the pub.

00:02:57.880 --> 00:02:59.590
Are you going to put on your hat?

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.080
And he will take the old woman's skirt.

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:03.930
This will surprise her.

00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:12.150
Here she comes. Red skirt, red hat,

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:14.130
top-cut knees, everything is as it should be.

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:15.850
Hey, little girl.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:16.600
You call me?

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:20.300
I'm Sigur.

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:23.750
God, what a coward child.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:27.320
Please don't be offended, but are you the red hat?

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:29.410
The red hat?

00:03:30.570 --> 00:03:32.210
Maybe you were expecting me from America?

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:34.320
What kind of kids are you?

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:35.680
They're all over the place.

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:41.400
Where have you been, little girl?

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:44.840
I'm going to bring this basket of food to grandma.

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:48.070
I guess you're the one who should be.

00:03:48.150 --> 00:03:49.650
You remembered the lines well.

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:51.970
I'm guessing something is wrong, but you remembered them.

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:55.180
Goodbye. I have to go.

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:59.970
That kid. That kid was very...

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:01.430
before they handed over the treasure.

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:03.250
His face is like a sword.

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:05.050
But he has to play.

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:06.470
He has to play the role.

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:08.730
And now, the first way to the house of the grandmother.

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:16.310
Can you see that I'm the strange grandmother?

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:19.510
Well, the hair hasn't turned silver yet.

00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:22.430
I want tasty food while I'm in Leguoto.

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:27.290
That there won't be a divorce with the grandmother.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:28.600
Oh, what an opportunity!

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:29.840
What a huge chance!

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.560
Don't take the red hat off my head with the sword's face.

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:38.610
The red hats were all sweet girls, charming and attractive.

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:51.060
A strong family connection.

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:54.600
Come on, get up, get up.

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:57.260
Come on, quickly, take off your dreadful sword face from the bed.

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:05.520
I am an old lady and you won't be able to grow old if you create trouble for me because I am merciless.

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:07.480
I won't show mercy. Stand in the cellar.

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:13.280
Oh my God, both of them are beauties.

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:16.440
I don't know which one is scarier, the old lady or the young lady.

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:21.720
And the red, scary hat.

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:22.980
What day is it?

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:25.460
Okay, come in.

00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:28.660
Hello. Are you an old lady?

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:29.740
Not anymore.

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:31.600
I doubt it. I'm not sure of anything.

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:34.120
Oh, what big eyes you have, grandma!

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:38.520
I'm not even sure I want to go through all this.

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:41.600
Okay, so I can see your sword face better.

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:43.300
What big teeth you have, grandma!

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:47.640
For you, for you... I won't tell you.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:49.370
I'll die of hunger sooner.

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:50.830
I'll just take the food from the basket.

00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:53.410
You're not my type of girl.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:57.890
I'm not a little girl. I'm the little Bubu.

00:05:58.450 --> 00:05:59.620
Bubu? Yes, yes.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:04.680
I'm sorry. Okay, you are Bubo. Now I will take the basket and it will disappear.

00:06:07.060 --> 00:06:07.320
No.

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:10.000
This is the scary old lady.

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:13.080
I'm not a scary old lady, I'm a scary old bear.

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:17.010
Bear? That explains everything. You have mixed up the stories.

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:22.310
This is not the golden-haired bears. One was hot, the other was cold, and the third was very good.

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:25.510
There were three bears. Where is the bear?

00:06:25.930 --> 00:06:29.740
What are you talking about, boys? Tell me.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.680
Where have you been?

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:34.090
To disappear when we have to make a show.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:37.480
The drums have to ring. Let them know we're coming.

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:39.090
Let's go to work.

00:06:40.930 --> 00:06:41.630
Killera, grandma.

00:06:42.890 --> 00:06:46.070
Okay, okay. Red hat outside.

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:47.790
Call now.

00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:52.480
Without a red hat.

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:55.780
Why do you have one?

00:06:55.940 --> 00:06:57.460
So I can see you better, dear.

00:06:57.780 --> 00:06:59.890
Take a little red hat.

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:01.020
She is very good for her role.

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:03.120
Wonder if there will be success?

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:05.500
There can't be no success with your taste.
